{"id":1060904,"chapter_id":1060904,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"就这样，芭·菲带着她的一大票西区朋友，还有被强拉硬拽来的你，一起出席了一年一度的新春音乐会。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"艾德","content":"这破西服的领口也太紧了，有钱人设计出来的衣服果然都是样子货……","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"希莉斯穿着一身漂亮的小礼服，但表现得也很局促，压低了声音说道：","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"希莉斯","content":"你以为不舒服的就你一个？我们不也没说什么，新城人都看着呢。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"另一边的雷登大爷则相对镇静些。毕竟是上一代的西区人，经历过西区尚未衰退的时代，是见过世面的。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"饶是如此，他也被周围新城人不怀好意的目光刺得有些难受，总是在不自觉地整理着领带。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"speaker":"艾德","content":"啧，不光是下面的，上面的那群狗东西也看着咱们偷乐呢。你说咱们非得来这儿到底图啥呢？","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"雷登","content":"来都来了。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"雷登大爷看了你一眼，生怕和他们一起出席的你也丢了面子。要知道这次他们能全员出席你可是磨破了嘴皮子……","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"艾德","content":"不去不去！芭·菲脑子坏了，还想着那个破音乐会呢，这不有病嘛！","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"speaker":"雷登","content":"是啊，局长。我知道芭·菲喜欢这些艺术啊演出啊什么的，她自己想去就算了。但把一大帮子人都带上，我们连一件像样的衣服都没有，这……","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"希莉斯","content":"而且她正在风口浪尖上，我们要是去了，她的身份一定败露。以后就算想，也回不去新城了。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"等等……咱们一个一个来。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"第一，去演出的衣服芭·菲都已经给你们准备好了。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"雷登","content":"乱花钱！她现在经济状况也不好吧？","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"content":"这个嘛……定制礼服退不了款，你们要是不去，芭·菲一样一分钱也收不回。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"speaker":"雷登","content":"啊？这……","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"content":"至于芭·菲的身份问题。这个你们倒是不用太在意了。准确地说，芭·菲自己也不在意了。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"content":"芭·菲如今在新城四面楚歌，到处都是敌人，她也的确需要你们的保护。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"content":"你们让我劝的我也劝了，芭·菲也没反对。等看完这场演出，她要是在新城实在待不下去，应该就会回来了。","style":2,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"希莉斯","content":"那……好吧。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"speaker":"艾德","content":"好个鬼啊！你们想去丢人自己去，我才不会主动去挨新城人的白眼！","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"content":"这个你是真没办法了。其他客观问题你都可以解决，唯独新城人怎么看待他们，你是管不了的。","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"content":"于是，你咬咬牙……","style":3,"background":1053,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"content":"咬咬牙的结果就是，你答应和他们一起出席音乐会，帮他们“壮壮声势”。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"content":"实际上你答应之后就有点后悔了。这种场合你是真不想来——无论其他人感受如何，你的体验绝不会好。起码那些一心想在西区异方晶矿掺一脚的投机者在演出过后不可能放过接近你的机会。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"speaker":"艾德","content":"哎呀这个破领子我恨不得给它撕了。你看人家局长穿得多随便，休闲装一穿再戴顶帽子，不比这劳什子礼服好看？","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"content":"你有些心虚地缩了缩脖子。来之前你想了半天还是姑且做了下乔装，祈祷楼上楼下的新城商人们不会认出你。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"content":"虽然违背了“壮壮声势”的承诺，但是……对不起了！","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"speaker":"邻座的观众","content":"喏，你看，“投资之神”的辛迪加朋友……","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"content":"现世报来了，周围人的议论声快压不住了。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"speaker":"邻座的观众","content":"哼……果然穷鬼穿得再怎么正式也压不住那股穷酸劲儿啊。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"speaker":"邻座的观众","content":"听说了嘛，“投资之神”可是卖了艾娃小姐送给她的VIP包厢票，就为了拉她这群穷鬼朋友来呢。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"speaker":"邻座的观众","content":"啊？真的假的？她不是待会儿还要做新年致辞么？怎么都沦落到这一步了？","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"speaker":"邻座的观众","content":"哈哈，你不知道么，麦克伦先生他们几个亏了钱的，知道芭·菲要带辛迪加人来，特意做的局。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"speaker":"邻座的观众","content":"哎呀你小点声，辛迪加人可要听见了……","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"speaker":"邻座的观众","content":"怎么，好意思腆着个脸来这种地方，听我说两句又不好意思了？","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"content":"你看着身旁的艾德一拍扶手，要不是希莉斯按着下一刻就要站起来了。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"content":"而此时此刻，那个真正位于风暴中心的人，坐在你们所有人最前面的芭·菲却什么也没听到，一心一意盯着眼前徐徐拉开的幕布，眼神一刻也没有离开过。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"speaker":"邻座的观众","content":"你看那个傻小子，一说就急眼哈哈。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"speaker":"邻座的观众","content":"别说了，小心人家打你。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"speaker":"邻座的观众","content":"他敢吗，这里可是新城，不是他们这种辛迪加不法之徒能撒野的地方……","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"content":"这下希莉斯额头上也爆青筋了。你眼见她毫不犹豫地掰断了脚下高跟鞋的鞋跟，和艾德一同缓缓站了起来。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"content":"随着灯光变换，一个高挑的身影出现在舞台的聚光灯之下。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"content":"原本弥漫的火药味一时间消散了。台下无论是新城人还是西区人，大家的注意力都被台上的人吸引过去。所有人怀着不尽相同的目的，期待着芭·菲开场的发言。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"女士们先生们，在现场又或者电视机前收看直播或是重播的朋友们，大家早上、中午、晚上好。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"content":"在聚光灯下与镜头前，芭·菲恢复了往日“投资之神”的风采，表现出一种奇妙的松弛和自信。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"content":"台下传来稀稀拉拉的掌声。新城人似乎对她的问候并不买账，一边鼓掌一边窃笑着交头接耳，等待看她的笑话。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"content":"芭·菲并没有对这稀疏的掌声表现出任何尴尬，等待掌声结束，继续朝着前方微笑着。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"我的名字是芭·菲，你们可能更熟悉我“投资之神”的外号。不过实话实说，没那么夸张，我只是运气好了一些，每次投机都选对边了而已。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"content":"芭·菲咧开嘴，亮白色的牙齿有些晃眼。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"我想在场的很多人都不清楚为什么会由我来做这次的新年致辞，这里我给大家解释一下。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"自108年脱口秀演员艾隆首次在新春音乐会致辞并大受好评起，之后的每一年主办方都会邀请本年度最杰出的喜剧人担任致辞人这个角色——毕竟这是新春音乐会，是一个轻松愉快的场合，用让大家欢笑的方式开场最合适不过了。但是……","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"在场的各位或许还是会疑惑：这家伙不是什么“投资之神”么？和喜剧有什么关系？是这样的——","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"“投资之神”在今年的下半年成功把自己活成了一个笑话。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"content":"此话一出，台下爆发出一阵哄笑。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"我在外邦投资了一笔生意，还没等那边的生意盈利，回到狄斯城一看发现天塌了。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"合伙人跑路，公司里多了十几笔坏账，要不是麦克伦先生仗义出手，我连和朋友一起来看音乐会的票都买不着。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"content":"说着，芭·菲对着贵宾席的方向做了个按住胸口的动作。那意思是“谢谢你麦克伦，友谊都在心中”。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"content":"镜头也适时切到了麦克伦那边，在欢呼和掌声中，他无可奈何地对着镜头点头假笑。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"content":"等到台下的骚动平息，镜头转回到芭·菲，她又笑着拿起麦克风，回归了正题。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"话说回来，真是让人难忘的一年啊，不是嘛？","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"这一年发生了太多太多的事，有好有坏，有悲有喜。我不知道该如何形容这样的一年，波澜壮阔？跌宕起伏？","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"抱歉，我的词汇量可能有些匮乏，毕竟你们也知道的，我是西区出身，没受过太好的教育。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"speaker":"观众们","content":"！？","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"content":"全场安静了一两秒后，呜呜泱泱的讨论声席卷而来——台下的观众也没想到芭·菲主动回应了外界对她身份的质疑，还是以这样的方式，一时之间人们不知该作何反应，直到有人带头鼓起掌来。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"content":"掌声之中，芭菲笑了笑，继续自己的发言。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"好在我们还有新春音乐会，有各位乐手和伟大的以亚欧大师在。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"我想，这就是音乐和艺术最美妙的地方了。无论你是新城人、西区人亦或是外邦人。无论你贫穷还是富有，快乐或是悲伤，音乐——","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_70"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"音乐都会记录并表达你在这一刻最真实的情感，并与这过去的一年一起，化作难以忘怀的美好记忆。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_71"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"来吧，女士们先生们，我为你们献上——115年新春音乐会！","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_72"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"content":"芭菲将手一挥，身后的帷幕揭开，全场的气氛随之达到巅峰——无论如何，“投资之神”的演说总是让人信服，总是让人不由自主地想要去相信。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"content":"既然她说这是最美妙的音乐，那么自己一会儿，一定能获得一场盛筵般的音乐会体验。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"content":"芭·菲笑着退场，并很快来到你和西区众人身边落座。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"content":"欢快而盛大的音乐响起，万众瞩目的音乐会，就这样开始了。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"content":"演出就这样继续着，音乐一首接着一首。你不得不承认，从某种意义上来说，芭·菲是对的。在家中、在电视上的音乐，与现场的感染力真的是天差地别。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"content":"也正因如此，所有人的注意力都被吸引到了台上，那股浓烈到刺鼻的火药味，也随着音乐的流淌，被悄然扑灭。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"content":"当芭·菲口中的以亚欧大师上台时，你不自觉看了她一眼。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"content":"惊喜、满足、享受、沉醉。这个新城人口中的大骗子全身心地投入到了这场演出当中，那眼中溢出的神采，真诚炽热到燎人。","style":1,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"content":"随着大师在台上深深鞠躬谢幕，这场新春音乐会就全部结束了。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"content":"芭·菲是对的，这是一场精彩到不容错过的演出。它会成为现场每一个不讨厌音乐的观众毕生难以忘怀的美妙回忆。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"content":"在久到令人落泪的掌声中，你和西区的大家一起，比其他仍旧沉浸的观众稍稍早一些离场了。","style":3,"background":2414,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"speaker":"艾德","content":"嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟……嘟嘟……嘟嘟……","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_87"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"content":"艾德哼起了曲子。你记得那个旋律——是大师演奏的最后一首曲子。","style":3,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"speaker":"希莉斯","content":"哼得不错啊艾德，没想到你还有这种天赋啊。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_89"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"content":"艾德红了脸，气急败坏地搡了希莉斯一把。","style":3,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"speaker":"艾德","content":"去去去……","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_91"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"content":"大爷解下那条整理了一整晚的领带，沐浴在晚风中感慨着：","style":3,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"speaker":"雷登","content":"真是没白来啊，让我想起了西区以前的日子……","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_93"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"content":"一行人沐浴着晚风，漫步在新城繁华的街道上。他们没了来时的抱怨和戾气。或许美好的音乐真的能洗涤心灵也说不定。","style":3,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"options":["这就是你的目的么？"],"style":6,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904091,"trial_step":91,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"这就是你的目的么？","goto":92}]},{"step":92,"content":"你快步走上前，问着芭·菲。她的步伐是最轻快的，一点没有“投资之神”该有的端庄。","style":3,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"您说什么？","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_97"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"content":"她还沉浸在刚刚的演出中，压根没在意你的问题。","style":3,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"content":"我是说……看来你大费周章回来，真的就是为了这场音乐会啊。","style":2,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"不然呢？","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_100"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904096,"trial_step":96},{"step":97,"content":"回答得是如此的理所当然。","style":3,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904097,"trial_step":97},{"step":98,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"画展啊、音乐会啊、花哨的美食啊……这些我都喜欢。可它们是上流人才能享受的东西。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_102"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904098,"trial_step":98},{"step":99,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"所以我就想方设法地混进来了啊，不惜当个骗子，昧着良心担惊受怕地赚钱。好在，我做到了。这些年，我享受到了这些原本不属于我的好东西。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_103"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904099,"trial_step":99},{"step":100,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"可是人的贪心是没有止境的。我越是享受，就越觉得为什么呢？为什么穷人就会被默认无法欣赏艺术和美好了呢？","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_104"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904100,"trial_step":100},{"step":101,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"为什么这些人类的美妙造物，就非得被地位啊、财富啊什么的绑定呢？我是靠坑蒙拐骗赚到钱挤进了上流圈子，有资格品鉴它们了，可我归根结底也是西区来的穷人啊。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_105"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904101,"trial_step":101},{"step":102,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"所以我要带我的西区朋友们来。这些东西那么好，穷人也好，富人也罢，大家都是可以理解和欣赏的。你看，这次的音乐会不就证明了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_106"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904102,"trial_step":102},{"step":103,"content":"你们看向身后的众人，他们依旧有说有笑地讨论着今晚的音乐会。","style":3,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904103,"trial_step":103},{"step":104,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"该享受的都享受过了，最想做的事也做到了，我这个“职业享乐者”也算是不枉此行了吧……嗯，我不后悔。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_108"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904104,"trial_step":104},{"step":105,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"现在，不管是惩罚还是报应，该来的就让它来吧。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_109"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904105,"trial_step":105},{"step":106,"speaker":"人群的声音","content":"我刚才看见芭·菲了，她就在那边！","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_110"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904106,"trial_step":106},{"step":107,"content":"身后不知何时传来杂乱的脚步声和呼喊声。刚刚还一副“不枉此行”嘴脸的芭·菲立刻拔腿就想跑——然而她穿着高跟鞋压根就跑不快。","style":3,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904107,"trial_step":107},{"step":108,"speaker":"人群的声音","content":"你确定和芭·菲一起来的人里有MBCC的局长？","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_112"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904108,"trial_step":108},{"step":109,"speaker":"人群的声音","content":"千真万确，我亲眼看见的！","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_113"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904109,"trial_step":109},{"step":110,"speaker":"人群的声音","content":"他俩关系这么好？我可是听说局长拒绝了理查德的邀请，那不就是说他屈尊去了普通席，就为了跟芭·菲一起？","female_content":"她俩关系这么好？我可是听说局长拒绝了理查德的邀请，那不就是说她屈尊去了普通席，就为了跟芭·菲一起？","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_114"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904110,"trial_step":110},{"step":111,"speaker":"人群的声音","content":"那不就是说……","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_115"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904111,"trial_step":111},{"step":112,"speaker":"人群的声音","content":"就是说局长跟她关系很好，芭·菲那家伙不是被MBCC抓了，而是在里面避风头呢！","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_116"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904112,"trial_step":112},{"step":113,"speaker":"人群的声音","content":"注意你的言辞，什么叫那家伙？是“投资之神”！","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_117"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904113,"trial_step":113},{"step":114,"speaker":"人群的声音","content":"你不知道，那个局长可难搞了。整个新城所有的投资者，上到市议会的，下到开发商，大家都吃了闭门羹，谁都喝不到辛迪加异方晶矿的汤呢！","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_118"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904114,"trial_step":114},{"step":115,"speaker":"人群的声音","content":"诶，你说，会不会芭·菲那个所谓的外邦异方晶矿，压根就是早早跟西区搭上了线，搞暗度陈仓那一套。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_119"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904115,"trial_step":115},{"step":116,"speaker":"人群的声音","content":"难说，那天她在直升机上往下面大把撒异方晶的那一幕你们不都看见了吗？她一个搞投资的凭什么能搞到那么多异方晶？","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_120"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904116,"trial_step":116},{"step":117,"speaker":"人群的声音","content":"嘶……异方晶、辛迪加人、MBCC的局长，这**……","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_121"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904117,"trial_step":117},{"step":118,"speaker":"人群的声音","content":"别废话！看到她了，快点别让她跑了！","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_122"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904118,"trial_step":118},{"step":119,"content":"西区的老乡们原本听到身后的动静也一脸如临大敌地护在芭·菲身前，但很快就被人群淹没过去。","style":3,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904119,"trial_step":119},{"step":120,"speaker":"人群的声音","content":"局长呢？我刚看到好像也在这里的。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_124"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2319,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904120,"trial_step":120},{"step":121,"content":"你的反应可快多了，意识到乔装不管用之后，早就趁着人群没来得及发现自己，绕进了旁边的一条暗巷之中。","style":3,"background":2102,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904121,"trial_step":121},{"step":122,"content":"你依稀听到人群中有两个还算熟悉的声音。","style":3,"background":2102,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904122,"trial_step":122},{"step":123,"speaker":"汉斯","content":"太厉害了芭·菲，这下真要逆风翻盘了。有这一手你早说啊？","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_127"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2102,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904123,"trial_step":123},{"step":124,"speaker":"艾娃","content":"跟你说了有用吗？就你那个看见辛迪加人鼻孔朝天的呆样，能理解芭·菲的手段吗？要不怎么她是投资界的神呢？","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_128"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":2102,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904124,"trial_step":124},{"step":125,"content":"芭·菲又说对了，他们这行是因信称义的。","style":3,"background":2102,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904125,"trial_step":125},{"step":126,"content":"在别人不相信你的时候，无论多么努力也只会招来诋毁。可当他们疯狂地相信着某些不切实际的事情时，再多的丑闻也只是无伤大雅的风流趣事。","style":3,"background":2102,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904126,"trial_step":126},{"step":127,"content":"这样想着，你不再逗留原地，快步向前，消失在小巷的夜色当中。","style":3,"background":2102,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904127,"trial_step":127},{"step":128,"content":"几天后的一个早晨，你如往常一样来到食堂，看见芭·菲正一手端着咖啡，一手拿着今日份的财经新闻，一如你们第一次在砂船上碰面的那样。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904129,"trial_step":129},{"step":129,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"早上好呀，局长阁下。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_135"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904130,"trial_step":130},{"step":130,"options":["早上好"],"style":6,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904131,"trial_step":131,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"早上好","goto":132}]},{"step":131,"content":"一个好消息，一个坏消息，先听哪个？","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904132,"trial_step":132},{"step":132,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"坏消息吧。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_138"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904133,"trial_step":133},{"step":133,"content":"坏消息是，即日起，MBCC的食堂不再对你开放了。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904134,"trial_step":134},{"step":134,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"天哪！怎么这样？！","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_140"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904135,"trial_step":135},{"step":135,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"MBCC食堂的餐品比之新城最好的三星级饭店也不遑多让，你们居然、居然要把我拒之门外……这真的是我一年来听过最令人痛心疾首的消息了。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_141"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904136,"trial_step":136},{"step":136,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"您快说说好消息吧，希望那能让我好受一些。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_142"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904137,"trial_step":137},{"step":137,"content":"芭·菲无比浮夸地捂住胸口，但实际上好消息是什么，她也早就知道了。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904138,"trial_step":138},{"step":138,"content":"喏，好消息。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904139,"trial_step":139},{"step":139,"content":"你指了指她手中财经报纸的头版头条：","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904140,"trial_step":140},{"step":140,"speaker":"报纸","content":"金融巡查组撤销对于芭·菲的指控，多家机构表示将会增加对郁金香控股的投入。","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904141,"trial_step":141},{"step":141,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"就这个？可这无法弥补我被MBCC食堂驱赶的伤痛。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_147"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904142,"trial_step":142},{"step":142,"content":"好了，别装模作样了，你公司的车已经在门外等你了，很长很豪华的那辆。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904143,"trial_step":143},{"step":143,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"时隔半个月，终于来了！","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_149"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904144,"trial_step":144},{"step":144,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"您不上车坐坐？车的内饰是我花了大价钱找最好的改装师设计的，车上还有我珍藏的美酒……","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_150"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904145,"trial_step":145},{"step":145,"content":"算了吧。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904146,"trial_step":146},{"step":146,"content":"你笑着又一次拒绝。还记得她当初信誓旦旦地说会有车来接自己，结果就是在冷风中瑟瑟发抖了一个小时。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904147,"trial_step":147},{"step":147,"content":"对了，希莉斯托我给你带句话。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904148,"trial_step":148},{"step":148,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"嗯？","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_154"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904149,"trial_step":149},{"step":149,"content":"她说你给她订的高跟鞋她还挺喜欢的，为了替你出头弄坏了，让你给她再订一双。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904150,"trial_step":150},{"step":150,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"没问题！","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_156"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904151,"trial_step":151},{"step":151,"content":"芭·菲放下咖啡杯，站起身。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904152,"trial_step":152},{"step":152,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"是时候说再见了。感谢您这段时间以来的招待，我们有缘再……","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_158"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904153,"trial_step":153},{"step":153,"content":"先等等，还有件事要问你。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904154,"trial_step":154},{"step":154,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"嗯，您讲。","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_160"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904155,"trial_step":155},{"step":155,"content":"芭·菲一点都不着急，笑盈盈地看着你。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904156,"trial_step":156},{"step":156,"content":"这些天我越想越不对劲……总感觉这件事从头到尾都有点不对劲。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904157,"trial_step":157},{"step":157,"content":"为什么你偏偏就能那么巧，买张票买到我旁边，为什么你的合伙人早不跑晚不跑偏偏在你回来的前一天跑，还让我看到了你那么可怜的样子……","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904158,"trial_step":158},{"step":158,"content":"为什么好巧不巧就得是新春音乐会这种所有新城上流人士聚集的场所，为什么我明明做了伪装却还是被人认出来了……","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904159,"trial_step":159},{"step":159,"content":"后来我就想啊，你再怎么说也是个靠骗起家的职业骗子，会不会这些事从一开始就是你自导自演，用来博取我同情和帮助的戏码呢？","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904160,"trial_step":160},{"step":160,"content":"面对你的一连串诘问，芭·菲很明显愣了一下。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904161,"trial_step":161},{"step":161,"content":"接着，她露出优雅又狡黠的笑容：","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904162,"trial_step":162},{"step":162,"speaker":"芭·菲","content":"那您有损失吗？您会……揭穿我吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60904_1_168"],"voice_bank":"vo_parfait_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160904163,"trial_step":163}]}